{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:813b958d6b4006c2","name":"Sith Sword","source":{"id":"source:reference-813b958d6b4006c2","title":"Sith Sword","revision":19028,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T21:10:10Z","sha256":"7ad21c5c4dbc4c8df835b6e4a2d7370f1bb018db70f5055fcf54041203983bf6","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19028","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Sith%20Sword&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-813b958d6b4006c2","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Threats of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Threats_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Sith Sword is a weapon created during the days of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Sith Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Sith_Empire","referenceId":"reference:303e4cc32aa1a8e1"}," using arcane alchemical techniques. A Sith Sword is physically identical to most archaic swords, though the alchemical treatment it receives makes it nearly as dangerous as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"},". A ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," does not ignore a Sith Sword's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Reduction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Reduction"},", and characters who are proficient with the Sith Sword can treat it as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," for the purposes of using the ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Block"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Block"}]},", ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Deflect"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deflect"}]},", and ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Redirect Shot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Redirect_Shot"}]}," Talents (and any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talents"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talents","referenceId":"reference:e8871b70ebfa07d9"}," that have those ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talents"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talents","referenceId":"reference:e8871b70ebfa07d9"}," as a prerequisite).\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Additionally, a Sith Sword becomes more powerful in the hands of a character who is steeped in ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Dark_Side"}," of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"},". A character who is proficient with the Sith Sword can spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," to gain a bonus to damage rolls with the Sith Sword equal to his or her ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side_Score"},". This bonus to damage applies to the next attack made before the end of the encounter, and activating this ability increases the wielder's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side_Score"}," by 1.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Simple Weapons (Melee)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Simple_Weapons_(Melee)","referenceId":"reference:cd7a4aafaae07eb3"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Medium\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 3,000\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 1d8\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 3 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]},